 established for strengthening the central support for postgraduate programmes as well as the monitoring of their quality in alignment with the University's strategic direction of expanding and providing quality postgraduate education. Responsibilities • Provide administrative support to matters pertaining to the TPg programmes administration, including student admission, data management, teaching support, examination administration, meeting logistics and quality assurance matters • Provide counter services and assist in office administration • Assist in student and alumni activities on campus or other University premises • Communicate with potential and enrolled students • Perform other duties as assigned by the supervisor(s) Requirements • A recognized bachelor’s degree or above • Good command of written and spoken English and Chinese (including Putonghua) • Competency in MS office applications and webpage applications • Good team spirit with a strong sense of responsibility Salary and Fringe Benefits The commencing salary will be commensurate with qualifications and experience. Fringe benefits, where applicable, include annual leave, medical and dental benefits and mandatory provident fund. Appointment will be made on contract basis for up to 11 months. Application Procedure (online application only) Please click \" Apply Now \" to submit your application. Personal data collected will be used for recruitment purposes only. We are an equal opportunities employer. Review of applications will continue until the post is filled. Qualified candidates are advised to submit their applications early for consideration. The University reserves the right not to make an appointment for the post advertised, or to fill the post by invitation or by search. We regret that only shortlisted candidates will be notified. Apply Now Share Save Job Lingnan University is an equal opportunities employer and we are committed to promoting diversity and inclusion in the workplace. Moreover, 